  // that lands while the deck is still gliding does not wait for the
  // animation: it jumps straight to its target, instantly (§8.4).
  // The 200ms are our own (requestAnimationFrame, an easing on the
  // remaining distance), not the browser's smooth scroll, whose
  // duration varies with the distance and cannot be promised.
  var STEP_MS = 200;
