    lightwebpres theme list --family terrain      one editorial family
    lightwebpres theme list --polarity dark --hue green  just the ones you mean
  Then apply one, at scaffold time or afterwards:
    lightwebpres init my-series --theme evergreen
    lightwebpres series theme set my-series --theme evergreen
  series theme set rewrites the one `theme:` line of templates/settings.conf
  and nothing else: your uncommented values are untouched and still apply on
